{"t": 1793283131506, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "settled", "Open-ground hint flip-flops while walking it: at (131,-84) 'about 220 to the north'; after following it 'about 250 to the south-east'; at (34,140) 'about 180 to the east', after walking 112 roughly that way 'about 210 to the west'. The hint is recomputed from where you stand, so the target jumps and distance grows; took ~2700 ticks (54 game s) and 6 F presses to find a legal site. Last two hints (60 W, 20 W) were accurate."]}
