{"t": 1793285600035, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "drought_after1", "Drought world event (tick 30551, first player event, ~611 game s in): sheet is clear - title, cause ('2 farms ... nothing for a day'), each option with cost and effect, 'The world waits while you decide'. Chose 1 'Dig irrigation ditches (15 wood, 10 stone)' while carrying only 5 stone: option was not greyed out, it went through, wood 44->29 and my stone 5->0; the other 5 stone was taken from somewhere (settlement store?) without saying so. Result toast and chronicle line are clear."]}
